{
  "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
  "juan": "Juan11",
  "section": "卷十一",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L000",
      "original_quote": "《卷十一》\n千金訣\n人專煞貢起例：四孟月甲子日起妖星，四仲月甲子日起惑星，四季月甲子日起禾刀。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L001",
      "original_quote": "\n逐日輪算周而複始\n妖星元武，惑星朱雀，禾刀白虎，煞貢青龍，直星金匱，卜木道符，角己太陰，人專金堂，立旱勾陳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L002",
      "original_quote": "\n三甲開闔圖\n孟甲，內開甲寅，合陽星陽氣在內，利主不利客，利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L003",
      "original_quote": "外闔甲申，合陰星陰氣在外，利主不利客，利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L004",
      "original_quote": "\n仲甲半開甲子，合陽星陽氣，利主利後應。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L005",
      "original_quote": "半闔甲午，合陰星為格，利客不利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L006",
      "original_quote": "\n季甲俱闔，甲辰合陽星陽氣在外，利客利傷兵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L007",
      "original_quote": "甲戌合陰星陰氣在內，利主利迎敵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L008",
      "original_quote": "\n禹罡圖\n凡出兵左足向前踏去，咒曰：「禹步相催登陽明，一氣混沌灌我形，天回地轉步七星，躡罡履鬥覺通靈，惡逆催伏妖魔群，眾星助我斬妖精，我得長生游太清」。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L009",
      "original_quote": "左右足一步一句念去，切勿回頭。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L010",
      "original_quote": "\n兵占\n論值符\n值符，士卒、旗鼓。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L011",
      "original_quote": "螣蛇，三軍司令。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L012",
      "original_quote": "太陰，陰謀、埋伏、私通。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L013",
      "original_quote": "六合，主謀臣、贊畫。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L014",
      "original_quote": "朱雀、元武，間諜、軍讓。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L015",
      "original_quote": "\n值使\n休，養生、納降。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L016",
      "original_quote": "生，休營壘、安軍圖。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L017",
      "original_quote": "傷，賞罰、捕逃。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L018",
      "original_quote": "杜，伏險、夜遁、堅壁。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L019",
      "original_quote": "景，投書、探聽。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L020",
      "original_quote": "死，行刑、錄囚。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L021",
      "original_quote": "驚，擒殺。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L022",
      "original_quote": "開，開壁迎敵、遣使。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L023",
      "original_quote": "\n十干\n甲，演戎。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L024",
      "original_quote": "乙，副將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L025",
      "original_quote": "丙，先鋒。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L026",
      "original_quote": "丁，說客。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L027",
      "original_quote": "戊，大隊。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L028",
      "original_quote": "\n己，輜重。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L029",
      "original_quote": "庚，勁敵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L030",
      "original_quote": "辛，游騎。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L031",
      "original_quote": "壬，騎兵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L032",
      "original_quote": "癸，天塹。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L033",
      "original_quote": "\n九星\n蓬，猛將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L034",
      "original_quote": "任，狻將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L035",
      "original_quote": "衝，戰將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L036",
      "original_quote": "輔，儒將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L037",
      "original_quote": "英，凶將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L038",
      "original_quote": "芮，頑將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L039",
      "original_quote": "禽，義將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L040",
      "original_quote": "柱，雄將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L041",
      "original_quote": "心，天將。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L042",
      "original_quote": "\n九宮\n一，申子辰宜水戰。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L043",
      "original_quote": "\n二，四維士利攻圖。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L044",
      "original_quote": "\n三，寅午戌宜火攻。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L045",
      "original_quote": "\n四，節炁。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L046",
      "original_quote": "\n五，節炁。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L047",
      "original_quote": "\n六，節炁。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L048",
      "original_quote": "\n七，巳酉丑戰。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L049",
      "original_quote": "\n八，四維士堅壁固守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L050",
      "original_quote": "\n九，亥卯未援解。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L051",
      "original_quote": "\n門戶\n陰六地天喜臨，勾白朱元忌照天馬，更坐天馬出行如乘飛驥。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L052",
      "original_quote": "\n三甲\n孟甲，合陽星陽炁在內，利戰。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L053",
      "original_quote": "合陰星陰氣在內，利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L054",
      "original_quote": "\n仲甲，合陽星利於後應。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L055",
      "original_quote": "合陰星陰氣在門，利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L056",
      "original_quote": "\n季甲，合陽星陽炁在外，利守。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L057",
      "original_quote": "合陰星陰氣在內，利主。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L058",
      "original_quote": "\n論干支\n日干我軍時干敵，日制時兮戰必克；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L059",
      "original_quote": "時干若或剋日干，號令三軍宜堅壁；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L060",
      "original_quote": "日干若受時干生，來將私意懷歸伏；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L061",
      "original_quote": "惟嫌壬癸作生神水土詐故也，須防詐降終無益；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L062",
      "original_quote": "時干若是脫日干，對壘之間閃賺的；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L063",
      "original_quote": "主客從來分時日，先起之兵即作客；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L064",
      "original_quote": "日支時支偏將倫，生剋休咎如干陳；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L065",
      "original_quote": "兩家納音宜究檢，先後勝負援剿因；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L066",
      "original_quote": "辨出行居生旺氣，休咎刑剋君莫向；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L067",
      "original_quote": "天罡六壬元妙道，煞貢人專與大安，明堂天德金匱較。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L068",
      "original_quote": "\n論值符\n值符占驗大將軍，本宮傳吉立大勛；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L069",
      "original_quote": "三宮檢點無凶礙，左右衝戰遂將心；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L070",
      "original_quote": "再將年命來參取，不值刑衝無禍侵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L071",
      "original_quote": "地天螣陰朱勾六，何者為仇何者親；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L072",
      "original_quote": "九地失刑防偷劫，九天害隔莫交兵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L073",
      "original_quote": "時日勿與值符害，方位宜同值符生。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L074",
      "original_quote": "\n論值使\n值使得令堪進取，地門有吉分正奇；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L075",
      "original_quote": "推詳主副年與命，臨吉門中是勝基；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L076",
      "original_quote": "倘值網羅並反伏，太公陰符不用之。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L077",
      "original_quote": "\n論十干\n奇偶各有所分屬，最忌囚墓與刑格；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L078",
      "original_quote": "制甲之神喜休囚，輔甲之神怕孤隔；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L079",
      "original_quote": "甲所用神如伏仇，本營奸究須推測；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L080",
      "original_quote": "查其本局孤與虛，系何奇儀落其局；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L081",
      "original_quote": "分局既值孤虛宮，畢竟吉凶半准的；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L082",
      "original_quote": "天用落宮與值刑，切忌臨此遭損失。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L083",
      "original_quote": "\n論九星\n九星旺方能取勝，休囚失地忌興師；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L084",
      "original_quote": "悖格飛伏皆難許，最羨吉宿得奇門；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L085",
      "original_quote": "天上風雷來助武，上下左右魁與魒；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L086",
      "original_quote": "躡罡履鬥丁甲使，疑神疑鬼壯軍威。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L087",
      "original_quote": "\n論九宮\n九宮起元考天時，地適三方亦証推；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L088",
      "original_quote": "水火金木土各別，主將年命莫教違；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L089",
      "original_quote": "正局老營堪立寨，過局輜重可屯棲；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L090",
      "original_quote": "將來局位伏接剿，奇正分兵奏捷回。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L091",
      "original_quote": "\n論門戶\n門戶忌迫墓格刑，欣逢遁假詐使來；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L092",
      "original_quote": "如若加臨孤虛地，出軍不利好逃兵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L093",
      "original_quote": "倘逢天乙登天門，煞沒神藏任取亨。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L094",
      "original_quote": "\n論三甲\n三甲詳分開闔情，開宜興師闔偃兵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L095",
      "original_quote": "孟甲反伏不宜動，仲甲反伏猶豫情；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L096",
      "original_quote": "季甲反伏背宜動，此從罡訣斷玄宗；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L097",
      "original_quote": "更有三加玄加臨，遲中變速動中寧；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L098",
      "original_quote": "孟甲加仲宜哨探，加季上面好進徵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L099",
      "original_quote": "仲甲加孟始當心，加季宮中快起營；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L100",
      "original_quote": "季甲加孟權駐北，加仲之時防伏兵；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L101",
      "original_quote": "陽時喜逢上剋下，陰時剋上亦稱情。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L102",
      "original_quote": "\n論吉凶\n返首一戰成功，跌穴伏兵取勝，天遁大開旗鼓，所戰必克。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L103",
      "original_quote": "地遁安置營壘，埋伏出奇。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L104",
      "original_quote": "人遁利偵探，神遁使陰謀，鬼遁偷劫可行，龍遁祈禱大利，虎遁招討，威振遠方。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L105",
      "original_quote": "風雲二遁抽避為良。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L106",
      "original_quote": "三詐爭戰定勝，五假變陣成功。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L107",
      "original_quote": "三奇得使，偏裨效力。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L108",
      "original_quote": "玉女守門，陰私可行。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L109",
      "original_quote": "三詐宮，百戰皆捷。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L110",
      "original_quote": "天輔時，有罪可原。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L111",
      "original_quote": "天三門，宜張招撫之旗。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L112",
      "original_quote": "地四戶須置埋伏之卒。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L113",
      "original_quote": "地私門潛藏之路，天馬方逃難之鄉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L114",
      "original_quote": "門吉、星吉、符吉，戰爭攻取均宜。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L115",
      "original_quote": "乙加辛宜防敗北，辛加乙宜勿圖謀，癸加丁軍謠有變，丁加癸將撖凝況，伏干當慮暴出之師，飛干恐墮敵人之計，伏宮勁敵難御，飛宮先鋒失機，大隔怕遭劫掠，小隔須防伏兵，刑格戰鬪罕利，悖格乍起軍驚，歲格主營生變，月格偏將受傷，日時格豈堪搦戰，五不遇切勿進徵，熒入白兮詐退而必返，白入熒兮窮寇而莫追，網羅豈避坑陷，返伏卻忌交兵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L116",
      "original_quote": "三奇入墓與刑制，副將援兵不協情。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L117",
      "original_quote": "六儀擊刑，戰雖利而有損。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L118",
      "original_quote": "門空制迫，營雖固而防衝。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L119",
      "original_quote": "\n官祿占\n論值符\n值符，官僚品秩生除謫降。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L120",
      "original_quote": "螣蛇，行人游府織造延尉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L121",
      "original_quote": "太陰，兵刑工廠錢。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L122",
      "original_quote": "六合，吏禮。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L123",
      "original_quote": "勾陳、白虎，總制鹽政。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L124",
      "original_quote": "朱雀、元武，科道稅水利營。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L125",
      "original_quote": "九地，屯衛有司。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L126",
      "original_quote": "九天，巡撫。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L127",
      "original_quote": "\n值使\n休，青、齊、吳、濱海。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L128",
      "original_quote": "生，幽、燕、揚。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L129",
      "original_quote": "傷，豫、宋、兗、濱海。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L130",
      "original_quote": "杜，鄭、荊、楚、濱海。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L131",
      "original_quote": "景，壅州、堂治。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L132",
      "original_quote": "死，秦、益、晉、土殼。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L133",
      "original_quote": "驚，趙、迎闔。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L134",
      "original_quote": "開，徐、魯、並御。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L135",
      "original_quote": "\n十干\n甲，督副。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L136",
      "original_quote": "乙，布政書院。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L137",
      "original_quote": "丙，禮科鴻儒。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L138",
      "original_quote": "丁，逃方。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L139",
      "original_quote": "戊，闔開主事必成。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L140",
      "original_quote": "\n己，鹽漕糧儲。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L141",
      "original_quote": "庚，提督刑科。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L142",
      "original_quote": "辛，按察。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L143",
      "original_quote": "壬，清理司。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L144",
      "original_quote": "癸，水利道。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L145",
      "original_quote": "\n九星\n蓬，總河操江。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L146",
      "original_quote": "任，太常四廠。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L147",
      "original_quote": "衝，織造。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L148",
      "original_quote": "輔，翰林。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L149",
      "original_quote": "英，通政行人。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L150",
      "original_quote": "芮，關帥總兵。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L151",
      "original_quote": "禽，撫臣。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L152",
      "original_quote": "柱，副帥戎政。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L153",
      "original_quote": "心，君臣。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L154",
      "original_quote": "\n九宮\n一，河漕鹽運。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L155",
      "original_quote": "二，有司。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L156",
      "original_quote": "三，禮部。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L157",
      "original_quote": "四，節氣申子辰巳酉丑。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L158",
      "original_quote": "五，節氣四維士。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L159",
      "original_quote": "六，節氣寅午戌亥卯未。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L160",
      "original_quote": "七，兵刑部屬。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L161",
      "original_quote": "八，鹽政。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L162",
      "original_quote": "九，吏戶工。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L163",
      "original_quote": "\n門戶\n外轉責天門，內轉則地戶，年命官星遇門戶，乘天德、天乙、天馬者，升；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L164",
      "original_quote": "年命刑、悖、格、伏宮，星與年命相傷者，降。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L165",
      "original_quote": "\n三甲\n孟甲，主春選、秋選。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L166",
      "original_quote": "仲甲，夏選。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L167",
      "original_quote": "季甲，欽取、行取。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L168",
      "original_quote": "吉星值開，利推薦。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L169",
      "original_quote": "凶星值闔，慎究參。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L170",
      "original_quote": "\n論干支\n時干為印日干官，納音藏化品秩看；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L171",
      "original_quote": "官印相生多利益，品秩衰旺逐時探；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L172",
      "original_quote": "\n傷符未保前程遠，傷使地方恐不安；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L173",
      "original_quote": "最怕截空與刑墓，升降謫除有來源。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L174",
      "original_quote": "\n論值符\n值符占官品秩階，旺相休囚著意裁；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L175",
      "original_quote": "\n誰生誰剋旁宮取，進退加臨官父諧；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L176",
      "original_quote": "\n不值刑囚並墓陷，定然榮任稱心懷。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L177",
      "original_quote": "\n論值使\n值使從來論地方，五凶三吉各分疆；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L178",
      "original_quote": "門凶得令堪終任，門吉迫刑俸不長；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L179",
      "original_quote": "\n乘吉逢生斷顯揚，遠近勞逸與殘廢；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L180",
      "original_quote": "更將祿馬考方位，入門飛伏可參詳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L181",
      "original_quote": "\n論十干\n十干則分所屬宮，本宮得令始為歡；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L182",
      "original_quote": "奇儀生合多獎薦，一值刑害參罰看；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L183",
      "original_quote": "\n合處帶刑池魚咎，比旺干旺不須貪；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L184",
      "original_quote": "只喜官爻奇儀旺，金章紫綬笑彈冠。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L185",
      "original_quote": "\n論九星\n九星恩難用仇分，恩星得地喜生君；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L186",
      "original_quote": "吉凶大小分僚屬，仇難無侵官印欣；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L187",
      "original_quote": "\n三方對照查衝合，旺相休廢著意尋；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L188",
      "original_quote": "最宜本符星旺相，威福從君可稱心。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L189",
      "original_quote": "\n論九宮\n九宮起元論轉遷，推選所屬逐元宮；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L190",
      "original_quote": "新舊起複宮局數，所治職事亦相兼；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L191",
      "original_quote": "\n水元轉金當署篆，木元轉水俸加添；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L192",
      "original_quote": "最忌官元入子舍，刑害空陷足堪嫌。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L193",
      "original_quote": "\n論門戶\n門戶內傳與外傳，年命貴人祿馬算；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L194",
      "original_quote": "吉星會合指日升，凶神迫害官不遠。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L195",
      "original_quote": "\n論三甲\n三甲開合有神機，開則推選合尚遲，孟仲季兮時令斷，半開半合卦中推。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L196",
      "original_quote": "\n論吉凶\n返首兮行取升擢，跌穴兮俸深歲深，虎狂兮筮仕不利，龍走兮任所蹊蹺，得遁格利以除授，逢假局可以挂冠，三詐利求獎薦。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L197",
      "original_quote": "三奇喜實，年命得喜，而上下歡悅。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L198",
      "original_quote": "守門而地方稱心，三門四戶切莫刑制，符、命、天馬、私門最忌。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L199",
      "original_quote": "勾、白、螣蛇夭矯，而地方有變。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L200",
      "original_quote": "投江而文案關心。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L201",
      "original_quote": "飛干、伏干在京科道之參罰。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L202",
      "original_quote": "伏宮、飛宮任所督撫之罪尤。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L203",
      "original_quote": "大隔、小隔，士民怨嗟，而居任不滿。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L204",
      "original_quote": "刑格悖格，同僚不睦，而官途多歧。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L205",
      "original_quote": "熒入白宜防賊寇，白入熒亦慎災殃。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L206",
      "original_quote": "年月日時逢悖格，已過將來事可詳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L207",
      "original_quote": "五不遇兮難以調選，六儀刑兮任所有傷，入墓網羅居官不顯，返吟、門迫，地到不良。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L208",
      "original_quote": "行使休囚，未必終任。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L209",
      "original_quote": "年命刑害，豈得還鄉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L210",
      "original_quote": "大約元星旺相，又得日時相幫，年命逢恩值吉，天乙守照為祥。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L211",
      "original_quote": "\n詞訟占\n論值符\n值符，問官。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L212",
      "original_quote": "螣蛇，稿房。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L213",
      "original_quote": "太陰，責罰。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L214",
      "original_quote": "六合，吏屬。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L215",
      "original_quote": "勾陳、白虎，催提、刑杖。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L216",
      "original_quote": "朱雀、元武，文卷、挑唆。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L217",
      "original_quote": "九地，贓物。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L218",
      "original_quote": "九天，上司。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L219",
      "original_quote": "\n值使\n休，彼此一般。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L220",
      "original_quote": "生，賄賂、囑托。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L221",
      "original_quote": "傷，總責、喝散。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L222",
      "original_quote": "杜，冤屈難伸。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L223",
      "original_quote": "景，文牒轉移。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L224",
      "original_quote": "死，贓執、追呼。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L225",
      "original_quote": "驚，定罪、虛驚。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L226",
      "original_quote": "開，訴辯得理。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L227",
      "original_quote": "\n十干\n甲，生於亥。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L228",
      "original_quote": "乙，生於午。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L229",
      "original_quote": "丙，生於寅。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L230",
      "original_quote": "丁，生於酉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L231",
      "original_quote": "戊，生於寅。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L232",
      "original_quote": "\n己，生於酉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L233",
      "original_quote": "庚，生於巳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L234",
      "original_quote": "辛，生於子。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L235",
      "original_quote": "壬，生於申。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L236",
      "original_quote": "癸，生於卯。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L237",
      "original_quote": "\n九星\n蓬，陰險星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L238",
      "original_quote": "任，遲滯星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L239",
      "original_quote": "衝，怒惡星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L240",
      "original_quote": "輔，恩赦星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L241",
      "original_quote": "英，喝散星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L242",
      "original_quote": "芮，贓吏星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L243",
      "original_quote": "禽，清星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L244",
      "original_quote": "柱，樸實星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L245",
      "original_quote": "心，喝散星。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L246",
      "original_quote": "\n九宮\n原文缺\n門戶\n原告責天門，辯訴責地戶，吉星同天乙生合年命及干符者，吉。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L247",
      "original_quote": "凶星勾白傷剋年命及符使兩干者，凶。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L248",
      "original_quote": "\n三甲\n孟甲，有驚。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L249",
      "original_quote": "仲甲，易散。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L250",
      "original_quote": "季甲，防險。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L251",
      "original_quote": "開值吉星者，勝。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L252",
      "original_quote": "闔值凶星者，輸。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L253",
      "original_quote": "\n論干支\n日干原告時干被，日支時支干証類；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L254",
      "original_quote": "納音所藏是問官，剋日傷時春妙文；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L255",
      "original_quote": "時日生合訟宜和，時日剋制勝負異；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L256",
      "original_quote": "兩支相會証作奸，兩支刑傷中証累；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L257",
      "original_quote": "日干如若傷時干，原告利口多惡意；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L258",
      "original_quote": "時支又或剋日支，詐証中人硬嘴利，本時干支同傷口，案倒如山真可畏，只看納音卻如何；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L259",
      "original_quote": "若要助仇擬罪狀，時日兩家定高低；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L260",
      "original_quote": "旺相休囚與死廢，旺氣制囚可望贏，囚來剋旺空費氣；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L261",
      "original_quote": "再看納音脫何干，就裏賄賂真得計；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L262",
      "original_quote": "更將年命納音查，生合干納方無慮。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L263",
      "original_quote": "\n論值符\n值符占訟作問官，符宮網毋酷與貪；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L264",
      "original_quote": "符傷日干責原告，符傷時干被告冤；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L265",
      "original_quote": "看其誰生誰受剋，兩家勝負可分端；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L266",
      "original_quote": "官符入官中駁類，官符入爻結案堪；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L267",
      "original_quote": "符空入陷無准的，日下審豁未可原；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L268",
      "original_quote": "朱蛇遙剋文案駁，陰六來傷樸責喧；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L269",
      "original_quote": "勾白制干差役惡，前項生合死為歡；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L270",
      "original_quote": "地屬有司作寇仇，時近衙門未可投；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L271",
      "original_quote": "天系上司若生合，狀投憲制可消愁；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L272",
      "original_quote": "更查逐日陰陽貴；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L273",
      "original_quote": "有如甲戌庚午類，幫扶生日得自由；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L274",
      "original_quote": "大約用神無代制，行進起脫可遨游。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L275",
      "original_quote": "\n論值使\n值使占事之起隙，各從五行分斷義；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L276",
      "original_quote": "木金相交門毀嗔，土木相持田宅類；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L277",
      "original_quote": "水火激搏奸盜情，旺相休囚孤謊議；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L278",
      "original_quote": "吉迫先勝後必輸，凶迫理直斷作屈；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L279",
      "original_quote": "必查兩干本門機，旺勝衰兮不須贅。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L280",
      "original_quote": "\n論十干\n奇儀子父與財官，年月日時十字參；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L281",
      "original_quote": "事跡須從六親論，審理時日官父干；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L282",
      "original_quote": "親怕刑兮干怕隔，休囚遲速可合觀；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L283",
      "original_quote": "鬼要空兮身要旺，父宜墓兮子當權；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L284",
      "original_quote": "最宜恩曜臨身命，縱然險危不到官。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L285",
      "original_quote": "\n論九星\n九星條分吉星生，吉星生合定稱心；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L286",
      "original_quote": "凶星激伐宜刑杖，看臨何干生何刑，\n性空本宮居旺氣，不犯凶星理自明；",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L287",
      "original_quote": "若是孤星又囚弱，縱然審斷不輸贏。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L288",
      "original_quote": "\n論九宮\n九宮論訟新舊情，旺則興訟衰則停，退臨後氣事已往，進臨來氣正當興，\n水元轉土堪結案，木元轉火訟又生，本局還歸本局定，此局當了莫生心。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L289",
      "original_quote": "\n論門戶\n門戶原分告與訴，告看門兮訴看戶，門不傷干原告呈，戶不傷干訴得利，\n門戶若是總刑格，勸君莫進公門去，官父二主制門戶，再傷年命恐囚系。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L290",
      "original_quote": "\n論三甲\n占訟孟甲是多憂，如逢仲甲便了休，季甲當符防罪責，開符理兮合生愁，\n若求用甲無刑害，官雖發怒亦當投，半開半合須澤比，較合時日兩干求。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L291",
      "original_quote": "\n論吉凶\n返首而原告欠利，跌穴而被告不祥。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L292",
      "original_quote": "虎狂、龍走公庭有傷，得遁賄賂可勝，許假囑托備良，三勝三吉喜臨年命，得使而衙役效力，守門而陰小作殃。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L293",
      "original_quote": "三門四戶切記日干時干逢悖格，經年經月始消禳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L294",
      "original_quote": "五不遇兮訟直而遭屈斷，六儀刑兮類神恐有徬徨。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L295",
      "original_quote": "入墓羅網不宜占訟，反伏門迫翻案迭詳。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L296",
      "original_quote": "符使休囚，雖訟而無益。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L297",
      "original_quote": "年命受剋，見官而乖張。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L298",
      "original_quote": "大約初入官司，喜遇官鬼興隆，久遭纏害，偏宜爻鬼墓絕。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan11_L299",
      "original_quote": "官父兩干無剋制，管取喝散喜非常。",
      "tag": []
    }
  ],
  "_source": {
    "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
    "juan": "Juan11",
    "line_id_start": "QMDJ_Juan11_L000",
    "line_id_end": "QMDJ_Juan11_L299"
  }
}